{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の暖かいコメントありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一つ一つ大切に読ませてもらいました\n気がつけば...ニヤニヤしちゃってたり、涙があふれたり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の私で舞台に立っていられるのは皆様の温かい気持ちがあるからなんだ!!って強く思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくhappyでポジティブになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとつひとつが、心に響きずっしりきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとーにささえてもらってばかりです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"sorry＆Thank You"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回とその前の記事でも書いたけど、れなりんの写メです！\nなぜかサイズオーバーではれなかったんよー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから私のこの技術でサイズをちいさくしたのだっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなりんお茶目〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口のなかに縦にキウイがはいってるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと弱音はいてもいいですか...？\n今の気持ちを聞いて下さい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前向きになる反面、気持ちが不安定になる事もあったりします..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、ずっと第二幕の時、控え室で皆が踊っているのをモニターで見ています！\n私だって２幕に立ちたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、公演も折り返し地点で、後半です。\n私は沢山頑張りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、選ばれないってことは、努力が足りないのかなっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですが、応援してくださる方がいてくれる!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様のアドバイスを思い出して、ネガティブにならず、もっと努力していきたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出たくても出れないメンバーの気持ちも思って！\nこの公演をステップにして、まあやが\n輝ける時まで、頑張ります!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんがいつも言ってるみたいに、\nポジティブにがんばります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポジティブに、前向きに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポジピーーース"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←かずみさんのまね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも優しいお姉ちゃんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は最高のパフォーマンスをしたいと思ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔で、全力で、思いっきりがんばります！\nどうか応援してくださる方に届きますように♪\n行けないけど応援してるよ!!って方に迄も届きますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙がかってに出ちゃうかもしれないけど、真っ直ぐぶつかって行きたいです!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悲し涙より、嬉し涙をながしたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか２幕に立って、思いきり喜びたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今できることを精一杯に、思いきり、頑張ります！\nこれからもずっと......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、まだまだなマアヤにどしどしアドバイス募集中です！宜しくお願いします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか内容がぐちゃぐちゃになってしまってごめんなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"重たくなったのでここで、ちょっくら違う話をしよう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、\nまいやん！\nいこまちゃん！\nさゆにゃん！\nひな(川後)\nななみん！\nマイマイ！\n能條！\n齊藤！\n斉藤\n他多数\nが、私のこと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒヨコ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒヨコ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでなんよーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そー言えば、私の応援団のもの真似とかしてくる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑運動会の応援団の経験有り"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーおもうーーー？\n私は本気よー！\n真似しないでー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上メンバーへの不満でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/7014183/0006.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}